ve of Nvidia.</media:description></media:content></item><item><title>Tired of Slow TikToks? This Content Creator Gives You the Ending</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/06/technology/tiktok-time-saved-videos-heyitsyoon.html?partner=rss&amp;emc=rss</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/06/technology/tiktok-time-saved-videos-heyitsyoon.html?partner=rss&amp;emc=rss</guid><atom:link rel="standout" href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/06/technology/tiktok-time-saved-videos-heyitsyoon.html?partner=rss&amp;emc=rss" /><description>Videos on social media often save key details for the end. One content creator, who goes by Heyitsyoon, skips the filler so viewers don’t have to wait.</description><dc:creator>Victor Mather</dc:creator><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 10:00:58 GMT</pubDate><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Social Media</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">TikTok</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Video Recordings</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Downloads and Streaming</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Computers and the Internet</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Tech Industry</category><media:content url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/10/28/multimedia/00xp-time-saver-promo/00xp-time-saver-promo-videoSixteenByNineJumbo1600.jpg" medium="image" /></item><item><title>Nvidia Scandal Puts Lori Huang, Jensen Huang’s Wife, In the Spotlight</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/11/technology/jensen-huang-affair-lori-huang.html?partner=rss&amp;emc=rss</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/11/technology/jensen-huang-affair-lori-huang.html?partner=rss&amp;emc=rss</guid><atom:link rel="standout" href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/11/technology/jensen-huang-affair-lori-huang.html?partner=rss&amp;emc=rss" /><description>Lori Huang, who has been married to the Nvidia chief executive for more than 40 years, stands out among tech titan spouses for how private she has been.</description><dc:creator>Erin Griffith and Don Clark</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 14:46:43 GMT</pubDate><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Jen-Hsun Huang</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Jensen Huang</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Lori Huang</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">NVIDIA</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Adultery</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Corporate espionage</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">HNWI</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Wealth</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Billionaires</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">1 Percent</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Philanthropy</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Computer Chip</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Personal Profile</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">People Story</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Alice Huang</category><media:content url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/10/multimedia/jensen-wife-jwtz/jensen-wife-jwtz-videoSixteenByNineJumbo1600.jpg" medium="image"><media:credit>Carolyn Kaster/Associated Press</media:credit><media:description>Jensen Huang, the chief executive of Nvidia, with his wife, Lori Huang, met as engineering students at Oregon State University. </media:description></media:content></item></channel></rss>